With Rell at peace, we will rebuild in his honor. We will do what we have always done	speaks	take the outcasts, the ones that don't fit in, and prepare them. Thank you, to you and your great Queen for setting Rell to rest. Take this offering, it's the thing of greatest value I can give you.” —Palladino
???	speaks	Hey kiddo.
The Indifference	speaks	But the in-kids don't care about the invisible outs. If you were alone in that drift... you'd need a friend... even like me.
The Indifference	speaks	Rap. Tap. Tap. You'll let me in, little piggy.
The Indifference	speaks	I won't let you take me... from me.
The Indifference	speaks	Let's have a little quiet. It's my turn to ask the questions.
(advances the dialogue)Kay	speaks	Close..."/"No. Try again."
(advances the dialogue)	Kay	speaks
(advances the dialogue)	Rell	speaks
(advances the dialogue)	Rell	speaks
(advances the dialogue)	Rell	speaks
Kay	speaks	Good Rell! You're learning! Well? Why don't you have a little rest then?
Kay	speaks	Go on Rell, which one?
Kay	speaks	Momma's... not... herself, Rell. I don't think... I think you should wait with the other kids, until they fix the ship. I love you but... you have to go! Go!
Kay	speaks	How dare you laugh at him! You should be ashamed of yourselves! Don't look away. Look at him. He's not invisible!
Kay	speaks	Well, love, I told you. You can't pet her that hard, be gentle or she'll bite. Are you okay, Rell?
Kay	speaks	Yes Rell! You make me so happy.
Kay	speaks	That's right. Different, so I love you even more.
Kay	speaks	Rell. Why?
Kay	speaks	Rell. You know why.
Kay	speaks	Uh, I think so... you're better with that stuff. But it's amazing isn't it?-
Kay	speaks	Yes?
Kay	speaks	Close..."/"No. Try again.
Kay	speaks	No. Try again."
Kay	speaks	Go ahead, Rell.
Kay	speaks	Yes, Rell—
Kay	speaks	And how about this one?
Kay	speaks	Good Rell!
Kay	speaks	No. Try again.
Kay	speaks	Close..."/"No. Try again.
Kay	speaks	Close...
Kay	speaks	And this one?
Kay	speaks	Very good.
Kay	speaks	Close..."/"No. Try again.
Kay	speaks	Close...
Kay	speaks	No. Try again.
Kay	speaks	This one?
Kay	speaks	No, try again.
Lotus	speaks	If Rell's been caught in a Transference loop for this long... the psychological effects could have been catastrophic. This 'man in the wall', these delusions, symptoms of the Void exposure all Tenno experienced. I hope that Palladino can find peace for Rell so this never happens again.
Lotus	speaks	Another, don't let it escape!
Lotus	speaks	There, Tenno! Trap it!
Lotus	speaks	And you believed him. You helped him do it.
Lotus	speaks	His Warframe.
Lotus	speaks	How could Rell have lived this long? Without the long dream?
Lotus	speaks	Alright, no more to be found here. Get to extraction.
Lotus	speaks	They are here - the Transference pieces. Track down these manifestations and capture them.
Lotus	speaks	Rell... it's just you, alone and trapped in a Transference loop. Don't give into these delusions of Void exposure. There is no man in the wall.
Lotus	speaks	Is that where Rell is? Has the Veil preserved him in cryosleep as the other Tenno were on Lua?
Lotus	speaks	Good. You've captured the manifestations here. Now get out before Rell's disturbance catches up with you.
Lotus	speaks	Another, don't let it escape!
Lotus	speaks	I'm detecting other manifestations. Defend yourself and try to trap them.
Lotus	speaks	You've run out of Kinetic Siphons. I'm sorry, there is nothing more you can do here.
Lotus	speaks	The manifestation is fighting the Siphon. See if you can damage it.
Lotus	speaks	It's too strong for the Siphon, try and weaken it.
Lotus	speaks	Tenno, you need to capture it!
Lotus	speaks	See if you can stabilize it with a Kinetic Siphon.
Lotus	speaks	Rell's warnings... those dire consequences... he was talking about Void exposure, wasn't he? The effect it has on human minds is well understood...
Lotus	speaks	These disturbances, they are Transference energy, split apart from a single mind. If we could capture them, send them back...
Lotus	speaks	Tenno - I have a theory. Return to your Orbiter and I'll explain.
Lotus	speaks	Transference energy, fractured. It was so... cold, indifferent, inhuman. If Rell was Tenno, what did he become without Margulis?
Lotus	speaks	Cast out... I don't believe you—
Lotus	speaks	What are you saying? That Rell is a Tenno? Impossible. All Tenno are known to me. I protect them, as she did.
Lotus	speaks	I don't understand. How would Rell know about the dream?
Lotus	speaks	Veil rituals will incite fanaticism, but don't be drawn in. I'm not convinced this 'Rell' even exists. I fear we'll have to play Palladino's game to find out. Ordis has been tracking Red Veil disturbances... that's the best place to start.
Lotus	speaks	Iron Wake. Steel Meridian has built an impressive base of operations right under the nose of the Grineer authority. The Veil's Speaker will be here, under guard. Find her.
Lotus	speaks	You were supposed to protect her. This mission is a failure.
Lotus	speaks	Tenno, if the Red Veil is in chaos we must intervene. Get Palladino to Iron Wake.
Lotus	speaks	I'm marking the area. Stay alert. It may be an ambush.
Lotus	speaks	Tenno? I lost you for a second. What did you see?
Lotus	speaks	Red Veil. Could they have done this? The Veil have been Meridian allies for years. Search for survivors.
Lotus	speaks	Blades. Too refined for a Grineer kill-squad. Is there anything else?
Lotus	speaks	Emergency power. Not detecting any crew. I don't like this. Search the area.
Palladino	speaks	They will have to. All of them. They owe you this. We all do.
Palladino	speaks	By sacred shadow and righteous blood - Blessed Rell! Your aged Vessel is dust and your chains are broken. Be free!
Palladino	speaks	Tenno! You need to save him from this... Destroy the chains-
Palladino	speaks	What have you done to Rell?
Palladino	speaks	Tenno- something's wrong. That's not Rell, that's--
Palladino	speaks	Holy Rell. You have sacrificed enough. Pass on your burden and rest. Tenno. Destroy the chains... only your sacred power will damage them.
Palladino	speaks	You may enter here, but only as your true, sacred form.
Palladino	speaks	This is why you're here, Tenno. It is time for holy Rell to rest. But I cannot bring myself to do it... to let him go. He's kept us, all of us, safe for so long and it's time for you to carry on. Release him, Tenno. Destroy the chains that bind the Harrowing vessel. He's earned his rest.
Palladino	speaks	Our temple. Our home. His tomb. Come. Meet our guiding light.
Palladino	speaks	Blessed Tenno, Rell has returned to his sacred vessel. I will join him there at once. Please, come, for I fear... I haven't got the strength to do what must be done next...
Palladino	speaks	Yes. After everything you've seen, wouldn't you?
Palladino	speaks	Yes. He commanded we chain it within the depths of the sacred temple. An eternal vigil against the Indifference.
Palladino	speaks	In a way, he didn't. He knew his mortality would undo his purpose, so he gave up his humanity, forever. He committed his soul to the undying vessel-
Palladino	speaks	No. We didn't have that option.
Palladino	speaks	I don't know if you can make Rell whole again, but whatever you're doing, this disturbance is growing stronger, resisting you. Don't let it stop you. Bring Rell home, to the temple.
Palladino	speaks	There! An emotion, manifest from the game Rell played as a child!
Palladino	speaks	But it's not. This isn't some kind of deep pressure bends as Margulis suspected. Rell saw what it was, truly. An entity, indifferent. Old as stars.
Palladino	speaks	Holy Rell, let us bring you the peace you have earned... Guide this Tenno so you can return to the Harrowing vessel... so that you might rest.
Palladino	speaks	This memory - his humanity still remains, buried in these emotions he so often failed to grasp. Could they be the key to saving him from this?
Palladino	speaks	He's here... The Donda, it's working, giving him humanity. We are listening Rell... Speak!
Palladino	speaks	Righteous Rell - outcast of sacred Void - hear my voice. Speak. You have been driven from the vessel by your suffering. You have swallowed the poison stars so we would not... Holy Rell, Speak! The Tenno who rejected you have come to your aid!
Palladino	speaks	I have served Rell my whole life. Studying Rell's teachings of the Void, the dire consequence of travelling by and through it. Now I see that it is true: he alone, in his harrowing sacrifice, has guarded us. What a price he has paid.
Palladino	speaks	Rell has become the very thing he warned us of. You cannot kill this, Tenno. Run! You can only run!
Palladino	speaks	Rell! What evil is this!? Sacred child, forgive me. I should have known the weight of the Void would one day crush the light from you.
Palladino	speaks	The Donda! His mother gave him this. Holy Rell was not like other children. Sound, color, touch... it overwhelmed him. The Donda's hum let him focus.
Palladino	speaks	The man in the wall! That is what he called it. Hush... try to follow his voice!
Palladino	speaks	Oh, but not Rell. Margulis cast him out, for he was different. Our foremothers took him in and studied his teachings. We became the Veil. The shroud of his blessed existence.
Palladino	speaks	Great Sentient Queen, forgive me, but what you are, what you've made of yourself... is merely drawn from the dreams of these divine children. You are not she, you are not... Margulis.
Palladino	speaks	These messages, they express Rell's suffering. He's lashing out. I should have seen the cracks forming...
Palladino	speaks	Find Rell's object-of-focus, child. You are close to this sacred relic, I am certain.
Palladino	speaks	(sighs) I cannot reach holy Rell from here. I will need his sacred focus: a relic stolen from the temple. I beg of you to find it and return it here. Only then, will he speak to us. Only then will we truly understand.
Palladino	speaks	Righteous Rell - of harrowed stars - of hallowed chains. Speak. For an age you've guarded the divide between Dust and Void. Speak. From within your everlasting sacred vessel, you've held the lidless eye. Speak!
Palladino	speaks	Hush, Rook, this is our sacred guest! I am Palladino. Holy speaker of the Veil, like my mother, and hers before... We speak to the other side, to him. Without his focus, I pray... I pray he answers.
Palladino	speaks	Leave your vessel at the door, sacred child. Come.
Palladino	speaks	Blessed star child, I owe you my life. Will you meet me at Iron Wake? Only you can right this wrong.
Palladino	speaks	Brothers of blood, sisters of fire, resist the muse!
Palladino	speaks	Oh holy child, I am grateful for- (her Kavat growls) What is it Rook? Are they back?!
Palladino	speaks	Great, blind,[sic] Queen... help me reach the safety of Iron Wake. Our sacred muse has abandoned the temple, leaving our people in chaos.
Palladino	speaks	Holy child of Zariman, please help me. I serve the Veil but the flock has been driven mad. I humbly beg for the protection of you and your vessel.
Palladino	speaks	Who? Rell, who is listening?
Palladino	speaks	Good, you remember. We want to help you, Rell. Tell us where you are.
Palladino	speaks	Speak to us. We're listening. What is your name?
Rell	speaks	Okay... Okay Momma.
Rell	speaks	This one, Momma. I feel... tired.
Rell	speaks	Mmm. Yea. I feel...
Rell	speaks	Mmm. But the man in the wall. Who will... ?
Rell	speaks	Tired: You run and run until you can't[sic, voiced "can't run"] anymore.
Rell	speaks	Scared: You look around and Momma's not there.
Rell	speaks	Shy: Meeting someone new and can't say hello.
Rell	speaks	Sad: Why did the babies eat the mother?
Rell	speaks	Happy: Momma has a stretchy smile.
Rell	speaks	Excited: All the spider eggs are starting to hatch!
Rell	speaks	Why are you helping me? You hated me.
Rell	speaks	Don't say that!
Rell	speaks	He's listening but I'm so... Help me.
Rell	speaks	Embarrassed: Talking and everyone looks at you.
Rell	speaks	Bored: Waiting too much. There is nothing fun to look at.
Rell	speaks	Angry: Someone takes the thing you love.
Rell	speaks	He's listening. He knows what you're doing. It makes him stronger.
Rell	speaks	Rap. Tap. Tap. I don't want to go back!
Rell	speaks	Mmm. My fault. Touching is too much noise. It makes me... makes me... angry.
Rell	speaks	Happy.
Rell	speaks	Mmm. Because I'm not broken.
Rell	speaks	Mmm.
Rell	speaks	So why don't they fix me?
Rell	speaks	Impossible speed, beyond the Brankle Gap constant.
Rell	speaks	We're in a ship.
Rell	speaks	Momma!
Rell	speaks	Momma.
Rell	speaks	Mmm... surprised.
Rell	speaks	Mmm... confused?
Rell	speaks	Mmm... shy?
Rell	speaks	Rap. Tap. Tap. Rap. Tap. Tap.
Rell	speaks	Mmmmm - No! MINE!
Rell	speaks	Mmm. Mmm.
Rell	speaks	Rap. Tap. Tap. The man in the wall.
Rell	speaks	Rap. Tap. Tap.
Rell	speaks	Rap. Tap. Tap. Rap. Tap. Tap.
Rell	speaks	Mmm. Can't. He's listening.
Rell	speaks	Mmm. R-r-r-ellllll.
Rell	speaks	Rap. Tap. Tap.
Ordis	speaks	You will need Kinetic Siphons to trap Rell's emotions. Simaris will have some for sale in the Relay.
Ordis	speaks	Operator, there is no evidence of any... thing... in the Void. By my calculations, Rell has lost control of his Transference. If we can gather these emotions I hope he will be himself again.
Ordis	speaks	Operator - Simaris may have a tool for this task. I wonder if his Kinetic Siphons could be repurposed to- bust ...capture these manifestations?
Ordis	speaks	Operator, what was that... thing? Lotus, can you explain this? Lotus?!
Ordis	speaks	Uhh... Waiting. Navigation is waiting. Oh, my.
Ordis	speaks	Operator! A Red Veil Seance! How... delightful? I have marked a possible Red Veil disturbance but... perhaps you would prefer to- brew some leaves and... Sorry. Navigation is bleeding, Operator.
Ordis	speaks	Steel Meridian has received Palladino. You've been granted access to enter their base, Operator.
Ordis	speaks	Sorry Operator. The message appears haunted - halted. It originated from a Steel Meridian ship near Earth. Will you investigate? I hope not.
Ordis	speaks	Receiving an all-call on our Syndicate frequency. It's a Red Veil encode but... it seems truncated. I will play back what I have...
